{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16629","headline":"人日陪宣州范中丞传正与范侍御传真宴东峰亭 · 鲍防","name":"人日陪宣州范中丞传正与范侍御传真宴东峰亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人日春风绽早梅，谢家兄弟看花来。\n吴姬对酒歌千曲，秦女留人酒百杯。\n丝柳向空轻婉转，玉山看日渐裴回。\n流光易去懽难得，莫厌频频上此台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}